(4234, 'Uttrakhand', 'Entry TAX*', 'Carrier*', 'Consumer Invoice+ e-commerce / Form17 ', 'Nil', 'Consumer Invoice + VAT Form 16(manual/online)>INR 5K', '', 'Entry permit for e-commerce B2C shipments (Air  mode) to Assam , odisha, West Bengal & Bihar is exempted subject to payment of Entry Tax. VAT from is applicable for normal B2C,B2B & C2C shipments . Shipper will rimburse Fedex for any payments of entry tax made on its behalf. Please contact is interested in availling of the service. Entry Tax process for Asssam, odisha & Bihar under surface mode is not yet started. COD service is suspended for kerala. '),
